rinna/japanese-gpt2-xsmall
--------------------------
The on-device judge (src/judge.rs) scores candidates with rinna Co., Ltd.'s
japanese-gpt2-xsmall (https://huggingface.co/rinna/japanese-gpt2-xsmall), a
Japanese GPT-2 distributed under the MIT License. The weights and tokenizer are
not in this repository: `mise run judge-model` downloads them and converts them
to resources/judge/ (q8_0 weights and tokenizer.json), and `mise run app`
bundles them. The MIT License text is the one above, with:

    Copyright (c) rinna Co., Ltd.

tokenizers, spm_precompiled and darts-clone (judge tokenizer)
-------------------------------------------------------------
The judge's tokenizer (src/tokenizer.rs) is a Rust port of the behaviour of
these crates, which Shizuku no longer links:

- tokenizers 0.21.4 (https://github.com/huggingface/tokenizers): the
  added-token split, Strip / Replace normalizers, Metaspace pre-tokenizer and
  Unigram Viterbi. Copyright (c) Hugging Face, Inc. (crate authors: Anthony
  MOI, Nicolas Patry). Licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
- spm_precompiled 0.1.4 (https://github.com/huggingface/spm_precompiled): the
  precompiled charsmap lookup. Copyright (c) Nicolas Patry. Licensed under
  the Apache License 2.0.

The Apache License 2.0 text is in dictionary/LICENSE. (The LICENSE files that
ship with both crates leave the appendix copyright line as the unfilled
template; the holders above are taken from the crates' metadata.)

The double-array trie lookup in spm_precompiled, and so in src/tokenizer.rs,
reads the trie format of darts-clone (https://github.com/s-yata/darts-clone),
