JMdict (EDRDG)
--------------
The English words for katakana loanwords (resources/loanwords.tsv) are built
from the JMdict dictionary file, which is the property of the Electronic
Dictionary Research and Development Group (EDRDG) and is used in conformance
with the Group's licence (https://www.edrdg.org/edrdg/licence.html). JMdict is
licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
License (CC BY-SA 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/. The
data has been modified: only the katakana headwords and their English
glosses were extracted and normalized by tools/gen_loanwords.py. The resulting
resources/loanwords.tsv is distributed under the same CC BY-SA 4.0 license.
Source: https://www.edrdg.org/jmdict/j_jmdict.html

